* @title Unary name operator
* @attribution Griswold 1971, Chapter 6
* @expect >>>
* BUMP SUCCESSFUL
* <<<
         DEFINE('BUMP(VAR)')          :(START)
BUMP     $VAR = $VAR + 1              :(RETURN)
START    COUNT = 0
         BUMP(.COUNT)
         BUMP(.COUNT)
         OUTPUT = EQ(COUNT, 2) 'BUMP SUCCESSFUL'
END
